  "TF Saturator": "豆腐能凝固器",
  "A machine that speeds up the tofu-setting process.\nRequires a TF Force, a redstone signal, and an empty block above it.": "加快豆腐凝固的机器。\n需要豆腐能、红石信号，并保持上方方块为空。",
  "A machine that can create special items or automatically craft items using standard crafting recipes.\nYou can select the item you want to make by clicking on it in the recipe book.\nCan be controlled with redstone.": "能制作特殊物品，或按标准合成配方自动合成的机器。\n点击配方书中的物品选择目标。\n可通过红石控制。",
