  "About soy-based dishes": "关于豆制料理",
  "If you want to cook these ingredients and make a better meal, try using a tofu hot pot!\nWith just this pot and the necessary liquids, you can make delicious food. Some dishes have beneficial effects,\n For Example. Dishes made with salt improve health recovery, Sesame removes the Mining Fatigue and blindness debuff., and miso will give you temporary resistance to bad status.\n so give them a try!": "想用这些食材制作更美味的料理？试试豆腐火锅！\n只需锅和所需液体，即可制作美食，部分料理还提供有益效果。\n例如，盐制料理提高生命恢复，芝麻消除挖掘疲劳和失明，味噌暂时增强对负面状态的抵抗。\n快来尝试吧！",
  "Tofu Metal Tools": "金属豆腐工具",
  "Metal tofu can be used as a substitute for iron. You can even make scissors and buckets with it!\n(Metal tofu buckets can't be used almost the same way as regular buckets due to their specifications, so it's recommended to transfer the contents to bottles first).\nyou can use metal tofu buckets to make soy milk from soybeans, just like with regular buckets.": "金属豆腐可替代铁，甚至能制作剪刀和桶！\n由于金属豆腐桶的功能限制，建议先将内容物转移到瓶中。\n也能像普通桶一样，用金属豆腐桶将大豆制作成豆浆。",
  "Tofu World's Diamond": "豆腐世界的钻石",
  "In the Tofu world, It has Tofu Diamond that harder than diamond.\nIt's difficult to obtain enough to make blocks, but once completed, it will be a long-term companion for tofu makers.\n\n TofuDiamond's strength may have decreased compared to before, but it still possesses undiminished power.": "豆腐世界有比钻石更坚硬的豆腐钻石。\n凑齐制作方块所需的数量并不容易，但完成后会长久陪伴豆腐制作者。\n\n豆腐钻石可能不如过去坚硬，但仍具有强大力量。",
  "How To make Natto": "如何制作纳豆",
  "Unlike Soysauce. The natto bed needed to make natto will ferment just by placing them down. Once they change color, simply remove them!": "与酱油不同，制作纳豆所需的纳豆床放下后便会自行发酵。变色后取出即可！",
  "To operate TF Force, you must first mine tofu gem ore in Tofu World.\n You should find it soon after exploring the area for a while.": "使用豆腐能之前，必须先在豆腐世界采掘豆腐宝石矿。\n探索周围区域一段时间后应该就能找到。",
